<title>UK: Deutsche Hyp adds 500 mln marks to June 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hyp adds 500 mln marks to June 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Pfandbrief has been increased by 500 million marks by joint lead managers Dresner, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Commerzbank and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFURT     SPREAD	+24 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED 24 BP OVER THE BOBL 122</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
